---
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Feels Like Om</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/type-system.css" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="/">Feels Like Om</a>
      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <details class="nav-dropdown">
          <summary>ABOUT</summary>
          <div class="submenu">
            <a href="/about/our-story">Our story</a>
            <a href="/about/getting-to-sikkim">Getting to Sikkim</a>
            <a href="/about/visa-and-permits">Visa and permits</a>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="nav-dropdown">
          <summary>JOURNEYS</summary>
          <div class="submenu">
            <a href="/journeys/the-flagship">The Flagship</a>
            <a href="/journeys/how-to-embrace-suffering">To Be Free</a>
            <a href="/journeys#feels-like-home">Feels Like Home</a>
            <a href="/journeys#way-of-the-yaks">Way of the Yaks</a>
          </div>
        </details>
        <a href="/reflections">REFLECTIONS</a>
        <a href="/contact">CONTACT</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="overlay"></div>
        <div class="hero-content hero-reveal">
          <h1>Who you are matters.</h1>
          <p>
            Slow down.<br />
            Make space for yourself.<br />
            Learn from the land and its people.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="scroll-cue" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="scroll-label">SCROLL</span>
          <span class="scroll-line"><span></span></span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="people" aria-labelledby="people-heading">
        <div class="people-inner">
          <h2 id="people-heading" class="reveal">Sewaro. Khamree. Hello.</h2>

          <div class="founders-grid">
            <article class="founder-card reveal">
              <div class="portrait-wrap">
                <img src="/zi-hui.JPG" alt="Zi Hui walking through a village in Sikkim" />
              </div>
              <div class="founder-copy">
                <p class="person-name">Zi Hui</p>
                <blockquote>“A tree helped me forgive myself.”</blockquote>
                <a class="story-link" href="/about/our-story#zi-hui">Read Zi Hui’s story <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="founder-card founder-card--placeholder reveal" aria-label="Elan profile coming next">
              <div class="portrait-wrap portrait-wrap--placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              <div class="founder-copy">
                <p class="person-name">Elan</p>
                <p class="placeholder-note">Story coming next.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ways" aria-labelledby="ways-heading">
        <div class="ways-inner">
          <h2 id="ways-heading" class="reveal">Inviting you to experience <span class="ways-nowrap">three ways of living and being</span></h2>

          <div class="ways-grid">
            <article class="way reveal">
              <p class="way-number">01</p>
              <h3>Nature-centric way of life</h3>
              <p>Here, people believe that all environmentally-born beings have spirits. They don’t ask “How can I benefit from nature?”, they ask “How can the nature and I take care of each other?”</p>
            </article>

            <article class="way reveal">
              <p class="way-number">02</p>
              <h3>Everything is connected</h3>
              <p>Life here is built on relationships. Relationships with family, neighbours, with rivers, forests, mountains. The whole is greater than the sum of the parts, 1+1=3.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="way reveal">
              <p class="way-number">03</p>
              <h3>Finding meaning</h3>
              <p>Intentionally slow down to silence the noise within and around us, so that what really matters to you can be heard.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="looks-like" aria-labelledby="looks-like-heading">
        <div class="looks-like-inner">
          <h2 id="looks-like-heading" class="reveal">What this looks like</h2>

          <div class="looks-like-grid">
            <article class="look-item reveal">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 30 32 12l22 18v24H10Z"/><path d="M24 54V37h16v17M17 27v-9h8v3"/></svg>
              <p>Stay with<br />local families</p>
            </article>
            <article class="look-item reveal">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 34c0 12 8 20 20 20s20-8 20-20Z"/><path d="M32 34V13M32 20c-7 0-11-5-12-10 7 0 11 4 12 10ZM32 25c7 0 11-5 12-10-7 0-11 4-12 10Z"/></svg>
              <p>Eat what’s<br />grown here</p>
            </article>
            <article class="look-item reveal">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="32" cy="17" r="6"/><circle cx="16" cy="26" r="5"/><circle cx="48" cy="26" r="5"/><path d="M22 48c2-9 7-14 10-14s8 5 10 14M7 47c1-8 5-12 9-12 3 0 6 2 8 6M57 47c-1-8-5-12-9-12-3 0-6 2-8 6"/></svg>
              <p>Gather and<br />share stories</p>
            </article>
            <article class="look-item reveal">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 17c8 4 15 4 23 0 8 4 15 4 23 0v30c-8 4-15 4-23 0-8 4-15 4-23 0Z"/><path d="M32 17v30M17 25h8M39 25h8M17 33h8M39 33h8"/></svg>
              <p>Learn ancient<br />wisdom</p>
            </article>
            <article class="look-item reveal">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 53c9-13 14-16 20-18 8-3 10-8 24-24"/><path d="M13 38h12l-6-10ZM42 24h12l-6-10Z"/></svg>
              <p>Walk slowly</p>
            </article>
            <article class="look-item reveal">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 15c8-3 15-2 22 3v34c-7-5-14-6-22-3ZM54 15c-8-3-15-2-22 3v34c7-5 14-6 22-3Z"/><path d="m45 12 7-7 5 5-7 7-8 3Z"/></svg>
              <p>Make time for<br />reflection</p>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="home-journeys-grid">
            <article class="journey-tile reveal">
              <a class="journey-tile-image" href="/journeys/the-flagship" aria-label="Explore The Flagship">
                <span>Flagship photograph</span>
                <span class="journey-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
              </a>
              <div class="journey-tile-copy">
                <h3>The Flagship</h3>
                <p>Nov 22 - Dec 2 2026</p>
                <p>Dec 22 - Jan 1 2027</p>
                <a href="/journeys/the-flagship">See more</a>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="journey-tile reveal">
              <a class="journey-tile-image" href="/journeys/how-to-embrace-suffering" aria-label="Explore To Be Free">
                <span>Journey photograph</span>
                <span class="journey-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
              </a>
              <div class="journey-tile-copy">
                <h3>To Be Free</h3>
                <p>Nov 5 - 12 2026</p>
                <p class="journey-note">Silent retreat</p>
                <a href="/journeys/how-to-embrace-suffering">See more</a>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="journey-tile reveal">
              <a class="journey-tile-image" href="/journeys#feels-like-home" aria-label="Explore Feels Like Home">
                <span>Journey photograph</span>
                <span class="journey-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
              </a>
              <div class="journey-tile-copy">
                <h3>Feels Like Home</h3>
                <p>Dec 2 - 9 2026</p>
                <p class="journey-note">Fully booked</p>
                <a href="/journeys#feels-like-home">See more</a>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="journey-tile reveal">
              <a class="journey-tile-image" href="/journeys#way-of-the-yaks" aria-label="Explore Way of the Yaks">
                <span>Journey photograph</span>
                <span class="journey-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
              </a>
              <div class="journey-tile-copy">
                <h3>Way of the Yaks</h3>
                <p>Nov 16 - 21 2026</p>
                <p class="journey-note">Recce trip</p>
                <a href="/journeys#way-of-the-yaks">See more</a>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="reflections" aria-labelledby="reflections-heading">
        <div class="reflections-inner">
          <h2 id="reflections-heading" class="reveal">Reflections</h2>

          <div class="reflections-grid">
            <a class="reflection-card reveal" href="/reflections#participant-1" aria-label="Read participant reflection one">
              <div class="reflection-image reflection-image--placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            </a>
            <a class="reflection-card reveal" href="/reflections#participant-2" aria-label="Read participant reflection two">
              <div class="reflection-image reflection-image--placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            </a>
            <a class="reflection-card reveal" href="/reflections#participant-3" aria-label="Read participant reflection three">
              <div class="reflection-image reflection-image--placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="more-reflections reveal">
            <a href="/reflections">See more reflections from past participants <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <script>
      const revealItems = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
      const reduceMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

      if (reduceMotion) {
        revealItems.forEach((item) => item.classList.add('is-visible'));
      } else {
        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries, obs) => {
          entries.forEach((entry) => {
            if (entry.isIntersecting) {
              entry.target.classList.add('is-visible');
              obs.unobserve(entry.target);
            }
          });
        }, { threshold: 0.15 });

        revealItems.forEach((item) => observer.observe(item));
      }
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #f4efe5;
    color: #18301f;
  }

  h1, h2, h3, blockquote, .brand, .person-name { font-family: Georgia, serif; }

  .site-header {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 5;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 4%;
    color: white;
  }

  .brand { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: 1.3rem; white-space: nowrap; }
  .main-nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
  .main-nav > a, summary { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; }
  .main-nav > a, summary, .story-link { transition: opacity 220ms ease; }
  .main-nav > a:hover, summary:hover, .story-link:hover { opacity: 0.72; }
  .nav-dropdown { position: relative; }
  summary { list-style: none; }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }

  .submenu {
    position: absolute;
    top: calc(100% + .65rem);
    right: 0;
    width: max-content;
    min-width: 12rem;
    padding: 0.7rem;
    background: rgba(244, 239, 229, 0.97);
    border-radius: 0.4rem;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(8, 20, 12, 0.18);
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    transition: opacity 160ms ease, visibility 160ms ease, transform 160ms ease;
  }
  .nav-dropdown:hover .submenu,
  .nav-dropdown:focus-within .submenu,
  .nav-dropdown[open] .submenu { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: translateY(0); }
  .submenu::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: -.75rem; height: .75rem; }
  .submenu a { display: block; padding: 0.65rem 0.75rem; color: #18301f; text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; }
  .submenu a:hover { background: rgba(24,48,31,.06); }

  .hero { position: relative; min-height: 100svh; color: white; overflow: hidden; }
  .hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: -2%;
    background: url('/hero-river.JPG') center / cover no-repeat;
    transform: scale(1.02);
    animation: heroZoom 14s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    will-change: transform;
  }
  .overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(8,20,12,.58), rgba(8,20,12,.22) 42%, rgba(8,20,12,.02) 68%); pointer-events: none; }
  .hero-content { position: absolute; top: 18%; left: 4%; z-index: 2; max-width: 92vw; }
  .hero-reveal { animation: heroReveal 1.1s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1) 120ms both; }
  .hero h1 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6.5rem); line-height: .95; white-space: nowrap; }
  .hero p { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.4rem); line-height: 1.55; }
  .scroll-cue { position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 1.25rem; z-index: 3; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: .55rem; transform: translateX(-50%); color: white; }
  .scroll-label { font-size: .62rem; letter-spacing: .18em; opacity: .9; }
  .scroll-line { display: block; width: 2px; height: 54px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.34); overflow: hidden; }
  .scroll-line > span { display: block; width: 100%; height: 20px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.98); animation: scrollPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite; }

  .people { background: #f4efe5; padding: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 8rem) 4% clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem); }
  .people-inner, .ways-inner, .reflections-inner { width: min(1280px, 100%); margin: 0 auto; }
  .people h2 { margin: 0 auto clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 5.5rem); text-align: center; font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.4vw, 4.5rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.04; }
  .founders-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); align-items: start; }
  .founder-card { min-width: 0; }
  .portrait-wrap { overflow: hidden; border-radius: .25rem; background: #d8d1c3; aspect-ratio: 4/5; }
  .portrait-wrap img { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 42%; transition: transform 900ms cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1); }
  .founder-card:hover .portrait-wrap img { transform: scale(1.025); }
  .portrait-wrap--placeholder { background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(24,48,31,.12), rgba(24,48,31,.025)); border: 1px solid rgba(24,48,31,.12); }
  .founder-copy { padding-top: 1.5rem; }
  .person-name { margin: 0 0 .8rem; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3.6vw, 3.8rem); line-height: 1; }
  blockquote { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.1vw, 2rem); line-height: 1.25; }
  .story-link { display: inline-flex; gap: .65rem; align-items: center; color: inherit; text-underline-offset: .35rem; font-size: .92rem; }
  .story-link span { font-size: 1.45rem; transition: transform 220ms ease; text-decoration: none; }
  .story-link:hover span { transform: translateX(5px); }
  .placeholder-note { margin: 0; font-size: .95rem; opacity: .62; }

  .ways { background: #18301f; color: #f4efe5; padding: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem) 4%; }
  .ways-inner { width: min(1280px, 100%); margin: 0 auto; }
  .ways h2 { margin: 0 auto clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 5rem); text-align: center; font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.2vw, 4.5rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.04; }
  .ways-nowrap { white-space: nowrap; }
  .ways-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); border-top: 1px solid rgba(244,239,229,.25); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(244,239,229,.25); }
  .way { padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); }
  .way + .way { border-left: 1px solid rgba(244,239,229,.25); }
  .way-number { margin: 0 0 2rem; font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .14em; opacity: .65; }
  .way h3 { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 2.5vw, 2.6rem); line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 400; }
  .way > p:last-child { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.25vw, 1.12rem); line-height: 1.7; }

  .looks-like { background: #f4efe5; padding: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 7.5rem) 4% clamp(6rem, 11vw, 10rem); }
  .looks-like-inner { width: min(1380px, 100%); margin: 0 auto; }
  .looks-like h2 { margin: 0 0 clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); text-align: center; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4rem); font-weight: 400; }
  .looks-like-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); border-top: 1px solid rgba(24,48,31,.18); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(24,48,31,.18); }
  .look-item { min-width: 0; padding: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.75rem) clamp(.75rem, 1.6vw, 1.5rem); text-align: center; }
  .look-item + .look-item { border-left: 1px solid rgba(24,48,31,.18); }
  .look-item svg { width: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); height: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .look-item p { margin: 0; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.35vw, 1.3rem); line-height: 1.25; }

  .home-journeys-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:clamp(4rem,7vw,7rem) clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem); width:min(1180px,100%); margin:clamp(5rem,9vw,8rem) auto 0; }
  .journey-tile { min-width:0; }
  .journey-tile-image { position:relative; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; width:100%; aspect-ratio:1 / 1; overflow:hidden; border-radius:1.35rem; color:rgba(24,48,31,.5); text-decoration:none; background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(24,48,31,.13),rgba(24,48,31,.035)); border:1px solid rgba(24,48,31,.1); }
  .journey-tile-image > span:first-child { font-family:var(--font-body); font-size:.8rem; letter-spacing:.04em; }
  .journey-dots { position:absolute; left:50%; bottom:1.25rem; transform:translateX(-50%); display:flex; gap:.45rem; align-items:center; }
  .journey-dots i { display:block; width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; border:1px solid rgba(24,48,31,.72); background:transparent; }
  .journey-dots i:first-child { background:#18301f; }
  .journey-tile-copy { padding:1.15rem .35rem 0; }
  .journey-tile-copy h3 { margin:0 0 .45rem; font-size:clamp(1.65rem,2.3vw,2.35rem); font-weight:400; line-height:1.08; }
  .journey-tile-copy p { margin:.1rem 0; line-height:1.45; }
  .journey-note { font-style:italic; opacity:.72; }
  .journey-tile-copy > a { display:inline-block; margin-top:.75rem; color:inherit; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:var(--type-cta); text-underline-offset:.3rem; }

  .reflections {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 8rem) 4% clamp(5.5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
    color: #18301f;
    background: #c88974;
  }
  .reflections::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -2;
    background: url('/hero-river.JPG') center 58% / cover no-repeat;
    filter: saturate(.55) contrast(.88);
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }
  .reflections::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -1;
    background:
      linear-gradient(rgba(184, 108, 84, .48), rgba(184, 108, 84, .48)),
      rgba(244, 239, 229, .28);
  }
  .reflections h2 { margin: 0 0 clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); text-align: center; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4rem); font-weight: 400; }
  .reflections-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 2rem); }
  .reflection-card { display: block; aspect-ratio: 1; overflow: hidden; border-radius: .2rem; text-decoration: none; background: rgba(244,239,229,.52); border: 1px solid rgba(244,239,229,.56); backdrop-filter: blur(2px); }
  .reflections-grid .reflection-card:nth-child(1) { transition-delay: 0ms; }
  .reflections-grid .reflection-card:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 140ms; }
  .reflections-grid .reflection-card:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 280ms; }
  .reflection-image { width: 100%; height: 100%; background-position: center; background-size: cover; transition: transform 800ms cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1); }
  .reflection-image--placeholder { background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(24,48,31,.18), rgba(244,239,229,.26)), rgba(244,239,229,.48); }
  .reflection-card:hover .reflection-image { transform: scale(1.04); }
  .more-reflections { margin-top: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); text-align: center; }
  .more-reflections a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .65rem; color: inherit; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.35vw, 1.3rem); text-underline-offset: .35rem; }
  .more-reflections a span { font-size: 1.4rem; transition: transform 220ms ease; text-decoration:none; }
  .more-reflections a:hover span { transform: translateX(5px); }

  .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); transition: opacity 800ms cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1), transform 800ms cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1); }
  .reveal.is-visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

  @keyframes heroReveal { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
  @keyframes heroZoom { from { transform: scale(1.02); } to { transform: scale(1.075); } }
  @keyframes scrollPulse { 0% { transform: translateY(-22px); opacity: 0; } 25%,75% { opacity: 1; } 100% { transform: translateY(58px); opacity: 0; } }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .looks-like-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .look-item:nth-child(4) { border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(24,48,31,.18); }
    .look-item:nth-child(5), .look-item:nth-child(6) { border-top: 1px solid rgba(24,48,31,.18); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .site-header { align-items: flex-start; padding: 1.15rem 1.25rem; }
